       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Ah, d-don't worry! They told me about your limited speech problem.",
       "transl": "Ah, k-keine Sorge! Ich weiß über das Problem mit deinem Sprachmodul Bescheid."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "thenStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "So...\\. you really are as \\c[1]over-leveled\\c[0] as they told me.",
         "transl": "Hm...\\. Du bist ja wirklich so \\c[1]überlevelt\\c[0], wie die anderen mir gesagt haben."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.glasses",
         "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "But I also heard you play with other low-level people.",
         "transl": "Ich habe aber auch gehört, dass du mit Low Level-Leuten spielst."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.glasses",
         "expression": "SMILE"
        }
       }
      ],
      "elseStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "But yes, we seem to be about the same level!",
         "transl": "Und ja, wir scheinen fast den gleichen Level zu haben!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.glasses",
         "expression": "SMILE"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So...\\. I could join your party, right?",
       "transl": "Also... Ich kann mich deiner Party anschließen, ja?"
